etect when I'm full of crap  and she's not afraid to tell me so and  to my beautiful wife Amanda you are my  balance you are my rudder you are the  love of the rest of my natural life  lastly I'm almost done lastly I want to  dedicate this amazing award to my father  who passed away three and a half years  ago everything this film is about all  the core themes perseverance discipline  stewardship are things that he taught me  and I could not have come this far  without his unfailing belief in me thank  you
 

